2. Content: all rights reserved
-------------------------------

Everything else is NOT covered by the code licence and remains all
rights reserved. That includes:
  - the words on the pages (biography, services, project write-ups and
    all other text), even where they sit inside an HTML file;
  - the drum and snare exercise PDFs (drum-exercises/, snare-exercises/);
  - the Suno prompt book (SUNO_prompt_book_David_Petry.pdf) and the Suno
    Prompt Toolkit (suno-toolkit.html, as a whole);
  - the artwork and graphics (art/*.svg and the site's drumhead emblem),
    photographs (gallery-*.jpg, og-card.jpg) and music.

What you may do without asking:
